<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Experience reports loss, writedown.</title>
<headline>NZ Experience reports loss, writedown.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				  8.92 vs 0.93 9-month loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				    9.49 vs 2.86</p>
<p>    Abnormals				    8.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax loss				 8.92 vs 0.93</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  56.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - The New Zealand Experience Ltd is a tourism company. The $8.92 million loss included an $8 million devaluation of its Christchurch Gondola assets and expensing of final acquisitions of $120,000 for the purchase of the Rainbow's End leisure park in Auckland.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
